classDiagram
    direction TB
    accTitle: owned passとflat arenaの所有・参照
    accDescr: GraphStorageがpass、Rasterバッチ、draw、定数、attachment、binding、accessの配列を所有する。Raster Operationはバッチとdrawを範囲で参照する。バッチはProgram、draw範囲、定数開始位置を持つ。各drawとDispatchはbindingの範囲を持つ。
    class GraphStorage {
        -passes
        -raster_batches
        -draws
        -raster_constant_words
        -attachments
        -bindings
        -accesses
    }
    class Pass {
        -accesses: Range
        -side_effect: bool
    }
    class Operation {
        <<enum_subset>>
        Raster
        Dispatch
        AttachmentPass
    }
    class ManagedRasterProgram {
        +mesh()
        +textured_mesh()
        -manifest: static参照
    }
    class ManagedProgram {
        -manifest: static参照
    }
    class RasterDrawOperands {
        -bindings: Range
        -vertices: resource_index
        -indices: resource_index
        -index_count
    }
    class RasterBatchOperands {
        -draws: Range
        -constants_start: usize
    }
    class RasterConstantWords {
        <<u32_words>>
    }
    class AttachmentOperand {
        -view: ImageView
        -ops
        -clear
    }
    class BindingOperands {
        <<enum>>
        Buffer
        ImageView
        Sampler
    }
    class ResourceAccess {
        -resource
        -range
        -purpose
        -stages: ShaderStages
    }
    GraphStorage *-- Pass : 配列を実所有
    GraphStorage *-- RasterBatchOperands : batches arena
    GraphStorage *-- RasterDrawOperands : draws arena
    GraphStorage *-- RasterConstantWords : constants arena
    GraphStorage *-- AttachmentOperand : attachments arena
    GraphStorage *-- BindingOperands : bindings arena
    GraphStorage *-- ResourceAccess : accesses arena
    Pass *-- Operation : 値を内包
    Pass ..> ResourceAccess : accesses範囲
    Operation ..> RasterBatchOperands : Rasterのbatches範囲
    RasterBatchOperands *-- ManagedRasterProgram : Rasterの値
    RasterBatchOperands ..> RasterDrawOperands : バッチのdraws範囲
    RasterBatchOperands ..> RasterConstantWords : 定数開始位置とProgramの幅
    Operation *-- ManagedProgram : Dispatchの値
    Operation ..> RasterDrawOperands : Rasterのdraws範囲
    Operation ..> AttachmentOperand : colors範囲とdepth index
    Operation ..> BindingOperands : Dispatchのbindings範囲
    RasterDrawOperands ..> BindingOperands : 各drawのbindings範囲
